# Deploy (ORG / sale app)

When anyone asks how to deploy, or before suggesting deploy steps, point them here.

## Safe command (preferred)

```bash
./deploy.sh
```

Uses systemd, last commit, keeps peer apps on `http://127.0.0.1:5055/`.

## Variants

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `./deploy.sh --fast` | Short same-port restart |
| `./deploy.sh --full` | Force full rebuild |
| `./deploy.sh --dry-run` | Plan only |
| `./deploy.sh --docker` | Docker path (also stable `:5055`) |

## Config

- `.env.deploy` (gitignored): `DEPLOY_HOST`, `DEPLOY_PASS`, etc.
- Live host: `root@62.60.191.21`
- Stable localhost proxy: peer apps always call `:5055`; backends are `15055`/`15056`

## Help banner

Terminals in this workspace auto-print deploy help. Re-show with:

```bash
